Below table represents One to Many relationship -
One student can make multiple home work submission, based on that criteria we created below table.
CREATE TABLE homework_submission (
	id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
	mark INTEGER,
	student_id INTEGER REFERENCES student(id)  // student_id is foriegn key column of this table, reference id column of student table.
);

